msgid "<a href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">Apprise</a> is a notification service that supports <a href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">many platforms</a>, including:"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">Apprise</a> es un servicio de notificación compatible con <a href=\"https://github.com/caronc/apprise/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-indigo-400 hover:underline\">muchas plataformas</a>, incluidas:"

